WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:03.390
<i>I didn't realize there was a torii 
gate and stone steps back here.</i>

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.120
<i>Did Bonta-san mistake this gate 
for the one we're meeting at?</i>

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.320
<i>If I climb them and check it out,</i>

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.490
<i>Abeno-san can conserve his strength.</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.350
Bonta-san!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.850
Bonta-san!

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.750
What's this pattern?

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.870
Bonta-san! Bonta-san!

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:27.880
What should I do?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.110
Bonta-san won't wake up.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:33.340
I need to call Abeno-san.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.230
Abeno-san!

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.880
Come quickly!

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.680
Please hur—

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.030
What's happening?

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.730
I suddenly feel pain.

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.300
If I collapse, too, then Abeno-san will...

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:17.930
Bonta-dono.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.380
This pattern...

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.860
Looks like he's been possessed by a yokai.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.500
This must be why his presence seemed 
slightly different from down below.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.360
Hairball...

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:35.640
I see. Got it.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.900
Ashiya's at the top of these steps.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.100
I'd better start by bringing him back.

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:23.260
<b>Mystery 13 "True Intentions"</b>

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:22.070
Damn it. My body won't move.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.790
Wh-Who are you?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.610
Ashiya!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.790
Release me.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.290
Okay.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.580
A yokai?

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:58.040
It must've been rough being trapped 
inside that tiny shrine all this time.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.710
I'll get you out right now.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.050
No! Don't!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:07.150
Don't!

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.440
You want to exorcise the spider 
that possessed me, right?

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.690
I won't let you do that!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.850
Sasa-san doesn't want you to do it!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:15.750
Sasa?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.530
Are you the one from the report?

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:23.610
Ow!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.070
No! Don't interfere!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.130
Stay out of my way!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:32.870
Bonta-dono?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.630
Don't move.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.760
I hate humans. I'll kill you, too.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.300
Golden eyes and golden hair...

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.560
You even use your influence.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:03.440
I haven't forgotten you since the 
day you sealed me in here, Sakae.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.480
Sakae?

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.620
I'll put you out of your misery.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.170
This power...

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.760
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:22.050
<i>If I stop using my influence, 
they'll attack me immediately.</i>

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:27.160
<i>This sucks. I'll have to kill them.</i>

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.510
I'll kill all the humans 
in the mundane world.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.660
I'll erase you.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:37.640
It's you yokai who will be 
erased from this world.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.350
See what happens when you remove the seal?

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:48.450
This is why I hate yokai.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:49.990
Are you...

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.290
Ashiya Sakae?

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:58.180
This one is Sakae?

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:02.080
I promise I won't try to 
lure humans here again.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.460
Please don't kill me.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:10.090
You can't expect me to believe such 
superficial pleading for your life.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:15.480
But if I trap you inside the shrine 
and command you not to leave,

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.350
maybe you'll be stuck in there.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:21.270
I've never tried sealing away a yokai before.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:24.630
Maybe testing it out on 
you isn't such a bad idea.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.100
Stay back! Stay back! No!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.070
This time, I'll make you disappear.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.870
I won't let you kill the yokai.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:38.620
Sasa-dono, go back inside. 
It's safer in there.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:40.590
Move.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.540
No.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.780
If we don't kill it, it will kill us.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:47.800
Move.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.110
No.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:56.360
I've never tested this 
against a human before.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.430
I'm curious.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.240
This is your last warning.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.650
Move.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.400
I will not.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.660
I see.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.120
Why do you protect the yokai?

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.050
Aren't you human?

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.530
Influence is a double-edged sword.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.960
Depending on how it's used, 
it can even kill yokai.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.560
Everything we do is to help yokai.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.160
That's what Aoi taught me.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.060
Aoi...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:50.990
Influence can be used to easily force 
yokai to obey, or even kill them.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:56.740
That's why I can't allow you to 
brandish this power in this way.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:59.960
And if it ever becomes 
necessary to use it that way,

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:03.240
that'll be my job as the master.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.510
I see.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.590
You weren't just protecting the yokai.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:12.590
You don't want Hanae to kill one.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:14.730
What about you?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.810
Do you hate yokai?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.960
Are you trying to protect your son?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:24.380
I don't know what you were 
thinking when you appeared,

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.480
but that's not him!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:36.580
When we first met, he feared yokai.
 He didn't like them.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.740
But now...

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.490
The more yokai he met,

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.330
the more he changed.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.380
He loves yokai.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:59.820
I don't want an employee 
like that to kill a yokai.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.530
Where am I?

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:19.990
Is anyone there?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.060
Excuse me! Hello!

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.540
How do I get out of here?

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:45.310
He loves yokai? How ridiculous.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:49.440
One of the yokai he loves is 
trying to kill both you and me.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:51.340
Come to your senses.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.490
Abeno-san! Abeno-san!

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.860
Abeno-san!

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:32.600
No.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.360
No.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.740
No!

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:40.730
Wake up, Ashiya!

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.510
I've reached my limit.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.040
Everything for yokai?

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:08.820
I can't believe you took 
Aoi's teachings seriously.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.270
Hold on to your stupid teachings

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:20.790
and pray I never return, Abeno Haruitsuki.

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.860
You're not going to kill me?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:01.000
I'm the master of the Mononokean, 
who exorcises yokai

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:04.070
to the Underworld where 
they're meant to live.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:06.530
I'm not your enemy.

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:11.620
I don't trust humans.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.280
Hairball?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.030
You're saying a human saved you?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.330
You want me

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.970
to trust these humans?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:09.480
I don't have to live in the mundane 
world and fear humans anymore?

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.670
I'll be released from this tiny shrine

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:17.980
and be free in a world where yokai live?

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:26.170
I'm terribly sorry your 
freedom was taken from you,

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:31.910
leaving you to spend an overwhelming amount 
of time suffering and hating humans.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:36.280
I humbly request that you let me 
exorcise you to the Underworld.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.980
You, too, Bonta-dono.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:53.110
Hold on a little longer, Ashiya.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.190
Huh?

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.450
You're awake?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.340
Why am I in the Mononokean?

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:14.950
I remember looking for Bonta-san, but...

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:20.320
I exorcised Bonta-dono 
and Sasa-dono just now.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:23.090
Sasa-dono? Who's that?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.600
Ashiya, we need to talk.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.840
What about?

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:30.930
About Ashiya Sakae.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.640
What's this?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.690
A report written by Aoi.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.420
See these drawings of cats

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.820
that have nothing to do with the 
written contents of the report?

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.100
Yes.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.810
There's one here, too.

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:52.940
They're a symbol of when 
Sakae worked as an employee

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:54.450
of the Mononokean.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.110
A symbol?

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:59.600
They must have kept his employment 
secret from the Legislator

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:01.720
and even the Mononokean itself.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.750
Sakae was an employee of the Mononokean?

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.050
But why did they hide it?

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:12.300
Probably because Sakae was a human.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:17.850
I see. Some yokai in the 
Underworld don't like humans.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:22.010
Since I only met him once, I never felt 
much of a connection with my father,

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:24.310
but now I feel an affinity for him.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:31.200
I've been able to determine 
the approximate date he died.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:36.710
Sixteen years ago, on November 2nd.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:40.890
Sixteen years ago?

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:43.830
Mononokean, what happened that day?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:51.340
It was autumn. I think it was 
shortly before I met Itsuki.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:56.300
Aoi returned much later than expected, injured.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.520
I was never told exactly what occurred.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:03.020
"I watched a cat die."

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:09.030
Saying that, Aoi wept.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.030
When you consider all of this,

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.270
that was probably the day Ashiya Sakae...

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.160
The day he... died?

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.170
A few pages were torn out.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.410
They may have described 
the events of that day.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.170
That can't be right.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.280
Three years later, when
I was three, he came home.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.250
My mom and sister saw him then.

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:36.510
That was probably Aoi 
transformed into Ashiya Sakae.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.440
What?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.270
They possessed a great 
ability other yokai lack...

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.560
The unique ability to appear visible

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:50.470
to any inhabitant of the mundane world.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:55.910
Even humans who can't 
see yokai could see Aoi.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.330
Then...

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.600
The person I've always 
thought of as my father

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.150
was Aoi-san?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:22.650
I see. That's why he disappeared 
again right after that.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.060
Why would Aoi-san do that?

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:28.470
Who knows?

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:31.440
Aoi is the only one who knew everything.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.690
So we didn't learn anything.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.030
Not quite.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.840
I searched the old records 
at White Sand Prison

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.360
to see if there was any 
record of what happened.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:43.700
White Sand Prison?

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.460
Ashiya Sakae could use his influence, too.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:53.170
He used that power to kill and banish yokai

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.340
in the mundane world.

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.360
For what purpose?

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.700
Aoi would never order him to do that.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:03.930
I can only imagine Sakae chose to do it.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:10.230
I see. That's why the Executive 
thinks I'm dangerous.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:16.480
If that's what he was like, 
it's no surprise that he died.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.790
We don't know that.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:18.740
Huh?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.600
The records of him simply 
disappeared one day.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.870
There's no record of his actual death.

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:29.280
See what happens when you remove the seal?

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:32.170
This is why I hate yokai.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:37.720
There may be some reason 
he hated yokai so much.

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:42.100
Abeno-san, you speak as if you've met Sakae.

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.900
Of course I haven't met him.

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:47.600
I'm just using my imagination.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.620
Right, of course.

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:56.380
But like you said, there 
must've been a reason.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.260
Yeah, there must've been.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:03.490
Do you still want to know 
more about Ashiya Sakae?

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.180
Yes. I want to know.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:12.150
I have a feeling that knowing 
must be important to me

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.110
as an employee of the Mononokean.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.210
I see. So the problem's gone.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.440
Yes. The yokai—

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:23.050
No strange occurrences will be seen again.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.920
Thank you, Abeya-kun!

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.110
You're combining our names.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:31.350
Please let us know if you 
ever need help again.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:34.270
I thought you might say that.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.890
I've actually received all these requests.

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:37.650
What?

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:42.780
So it was a pig yokai.

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.360
I lost consciousness during the job, though.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.590
You lost consciousness?

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:48.910
He fell down some stairs and hit his head.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.760
Apparently.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.420
But Abeno-san exorcised him.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.050
Ashiya, you're leaving already?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.960
Hello, Yahiko.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.280
What's my snack today?

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:03.740
There's no snack for you.

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:06.780
If you don't give me snacks, 
I won't listen to you.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.160
Oh, I don't need you to do that anymore.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.020
What? No, no!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.760
Gimme snacks! Ashiya!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:15.440
What was that about?

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:17.730
No, no, no! Snacks!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.770
Who knows?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.730
Huh?

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.740
Ashiya, snacks!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:41.880
Itsuki...

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:45.510
Will you tell me what happened?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.270
Ashiya Sakae is inside Hanae?

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.770
Yeah. Judging by his behavior,

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:57.750
he doesn't remember becoming Ashiya Sakae.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.280
But...

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.280
I know.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.410
The Legislator...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.660
the Justice, and...

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:07.800
the Executive.

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:12.550
If those three were to learn the truth...

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.170
Hanae would be in danger.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.670
<i>In other words, as long 
as I keep my mouth shut...</i>

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:49.030
You're late, Abeno-san.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.170
Did you get lost in thought?

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:56.590
<i>As long as I keep my mouth shut,</i>

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.650
<i>everything will be fine.</i>

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.520
<i>Right...</i>

00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:01.540
Aoi?
